@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Account and Team Role API
	Testing Koroneiki Account API functionality in relation to Team Roles.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the teams on koroneiki with the following names
	| Development Team |
	| Marketing Team   |
	| Engineering Team |
	| Sales Team       |
	* I tear down the team roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Optional Account Role |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |

Scenario: Assign account team role to team
	Koroneiki teams should be able to be assigned to team roles on accounts.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I assign the team with the name "Development Team" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles
	| Default Account Role |
	Then the team with the name "Development Team" should be assigned to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And the team with the name "Development Team" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the team role "Default Account Role"
	And I should be able to view an assigned account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" for the team "Development Team" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the following values
	| Assigned Team Nested Field | Development Team                         | |
	| Code                       | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address      | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description                | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number                 | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                       | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number               | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address      | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                     | United States                            | |
	| Status                     | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                       | T4                                       | |
	| Website                    | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |

