Scenario: Assign separate account team roles to teams
	Separate koroneiki account team roles should be able to be assigned to separate teams.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a team with the name "Development Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I create a team with the name "Marketing Team" for the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | Optional Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I assign the team with the name "Development Team" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles
	| Default Account Role |
	And I assign the team with the name "Marketing Team" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles
	| Optional Account Role |
	Then the team with the name "Development Team" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the team role "Default Account Role"
	And the team with the name "Marketing Team" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the team role "Optional Account Role"
	And the team with the name "Development Team" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should not have the team role "Optional Account Role"
	And the team with the name "Marketing Team" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should not have the team role "Default Account Role"

